!!!description_110 : ((LA_499)) ((sumti_tail_111)) ((gap_450)) | ((LE_488 sumti_tail_111)) ((gap_450)) ;

This phrase may be an entire sumti of its own, of the kind "le cmavo",
or "la tsali". It is referenced, with many layers of indirection, from
((sumti_90)).

A "sumti tail" is almost the same as a ((bridi tail)), except that there are
many additional possible phrases that can only occur inside a
description.

((gap_450)) is essentially a slot for the ((elidable terminator)) ((KU)).

Note that this rule covers all gadri. LO-series is a part of selma'o ((LE)).
